@function [Hello]:
    @output Hello
@end

@function [number10]:
    @output number 1
    @output number 10
@end

@function [1]
    :output 1
@end

@call :function[Hello]
@call :function[number10]
@call :function[1]

@output If the following output were sent in this order:
@output #: Hello
@output #: number 1
@output #: number 10
@output #: 1
@output Then the following file: functionState.debug has been sucessfully ran.